{"id":"8e064f5541310748","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-pseudointersection.md","title":"ZFC Pseudointersection","display":"df-zfc-pseudointersection — ZFC Pseudointersection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pseudointersection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pseudointersection"],"display":"df-zfc-pseudointersection — ZFC Pseudointersection","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pseudointersection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pseudointersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pseudointersection — ZFC Pseudointersection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pseudointersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S(X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\setminus A\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pseudointersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S(X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\setminus A\\in[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The family is typed as infinite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, and almost inclusion is expanded as finite difference.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。 $[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"[\\omega]^\\omega\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega):\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pseudointersection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S(X,\\mathcal A) \\leftrightarrow \\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\setminus A\\in[\\omega]^{<\\omega})","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1046,"backlinks":[{"id":"9f9d39dd9ebb5ced","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Pseudointersection}_S$ (pseudointersection predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-pseudointersection]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3212","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-pseudointersection.md|58-df-zfc-pseudointersection]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2be08d4ee8aa1590","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}